    "text": "Be cinincge.\nCristenum cyninge gebyra\u00f0 swi\u00f0e rihte, \u00fe\u00e6t he sy on f\u00e6der st\u00e6le cristenra \u00feeode and on ware and on\nAnd \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t he sceal ge\u00feeon Gode, \u00fee he riht lufige and unriht ascunige.\nAnd him gebyre\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t he geornlice fylste \u00feam, \u00fee riht willan, and a hetelice styre \u00feam, \u00fee \u00fewyres\nHe sceal mand\u00e6de men \u00fereagean \u00feearle mid woroldlicre steore, and he sceal ryperas and reaferas and\n\u00d0\u00e6t bi\u00f0 cyninges riht and cynelic gewuna, and \u00fe\u00e6t sceal on \u00feeode swy\u00feost gefremian.\nLa, \u00feurh hw\u00e6t sceal Godes \u00feeowum and Godes \u00feearfum fri\u00f0 and fultum cuman butan \u00feurh Crist and\n\u00d0urh cyninges wisdom folc wyr\u00f0 ges\u00e6lig, gesundful and sigef\u00e6st.\nAnd \u00fey sceal wis cyning christendom and cynedom miclian and m\u00e6rsian, and a he sceal h\u00e6\u00feendom\nHe sceal boclarum hlystan swy\u00fee georne and Godes beboda geornlice healdan and gelome wi\u00f0 witan\nAnd gif hwa to \u00feam str\u00e6c sy ahwar on \u00feeode, \u00fe\u00e6t riht nelle healdan , swa swa he scolde, ac Godes lage\nAnd do, swa him \u00feearf is: cl\u00e6nsige his \u00feeode for Gode and for worolde, gif he Godes miltse geearnian\nBe cinedome.\nEahta sweras syndon, \u00fee rihtlicne cynedom trumlice upwega\u00f0: So\u00f0f\u00e6stnes ueritas and mod\u00few\u00e6rnes\nAnd seofon \u00feing gedafenia\u00f0 rihtwisum cyninge: An \u00e6rest, \u00fe\u00e6t he swi\u00fee micelne Godes ege h\u00e6bbe\nAnd feor\u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6t he sti\u00f0mod sy wi\u00f0 ifele superbum in malos.\nAnd fifte, \u00fe\u00e6t he a symle \u00feearfena helpe pauperes pascere.\nAnd sixte, \u00fe\u00e6t he Godes circan for\u00f0ige and fri\u00f0ige ecclesiam dei adiuuare et defendere.\nAnd seofo\u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6t he be freondum and fremdan fadige gelice on rihtlican dome inter propinquos et\n\u00c6lc, cynestol stent on \u00ferim stapelum, \u00fee fullice ariht stent: An is Oratores, And o\u00f0er is Laboratores,\nOratores syndon gebedmen, \u00fee Gode sculon \u00feeowian and d\u00e6ges and nihtes for ealne \u00feeodscipe \u00feingian\nLaboratores sindon weorcmen, \u00fee tilian sculon, \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee eal \u00feeodscipe big sceal libban.\nBellatores syndon wigmen, \u00fee eard sculon werian wiglice mid w\u00e6pnum.\nOn \u00feisum \u00ferim stapelum sceal \u00e6lc cynestol standan mid rihte.\nAnd awacige heora \u00e6nig, sona se stol scilf\u00f0; and forberste heora \u00e6nig \u00feonne rist se stol ny\u00f0er, and \u00fe\u00e6t\nAc sta\u00f0elige man and strangige and trimme hi georne mid wislicre Godes lage; \u00fe\u00e6t wur\u00f0 \u00feam\nFor\u00f0am so\u00f0 is, \u00fe\u00e6t ic secge: awacige se cristendom, sona scylf\u00f0 se cynedom, And ar\u00e6re man unlaga\nAc do man, swa hit \u00feearf is alecge man unriht and ar\u00e6re up Godes riht; \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6g to \u00feearfe for Gode\nPaulus dicit: Oportet enim episcopum inreprehensibilem esse, et reliqua Biscopum gebiria\u00f0 ealdlice\nNe gerisa\u00f0 heom prita ne idela r\u00e6nca ne micele ofermetta ne r\u00e6de weametta ne \u00e6nige higeliste wordes\nAc \u00fe\u00e6t him bi\u00f0 weor\u00f0lic, \u00fe\u00e6t hi a habban arwur\u00f0e wisan on eallum heora \u00feeawum and be\u00feencan heora\nFor\u00f0am so\u00f0 is, \u00fe\u00e6t ic secge, gelife, se \u00fee wille: heardlic eornost and wislic w\u00e6rscipe and stedef\u00e6st\nAnd huru ne gerise\u00f0 biscopum \u00e6fre ne \u00e6t ham ne on si\u00f0e to higeleas wise, ac wisdom and weor\u00f0scipe\nByscopas sculon bocum and gebedum filigan and d\u00e6ges and nihtes oft and gelome clipian to Criste and\nAnd hi sculon leornian and rihtlice l\u00e6ran and ymbe folces d\u00e6da geornlice smeagan.\nAnd hig sculon bodian and bisnian georne godcunde \u00feearfe cristenre \u00feeode.\nAnd ne sculon hi \u00e6nig unriht willes ge\u00feafian, ac to \u00e6lcan rihte geornlice filstan.\nHi sculon Godes ege habban on gemynde and ne eargian for worldege ealles to swi\u00f0e.\nAc bodian hi symle Godes riht georne and unriht forbeodan, gime, se \u00fee wille.\nFor\u00f0am wace bi\u00f0 se hirda funden to heorde, \u00fee nele \u00fea heorde, \u00fee he healdan sceal, mid clipunge\nNis nan swa yfel sca\u00f0a, swa is deofol silf.\nHe bi\u00f0 aa ymbe \u00fe\u00e6t an, hu he on manna sawlum m\u00e6st gesca\u00f0ian m\u00e6ge.\n\u00deonne motan \u00fea hyrdas beon swi\u00f0e wacole and geornlice clipigende, \u00fee wi\u00f0 \u00feone \u00feeodsca\u00f0an folce\n\u00d0\u00e6t sindon biscopas and m\u00e6ssepreostas, \u00fee godcunde heorde gewarian and bewerian sculon mid\nAnd se \u00f0e oferhogige, \u00fe\u00e6t he heom hliste, habbe him gem\u00e6ne \u00fe\u00e6t wi\u00fe God silfne.\nEala, fela is swa\u00feeah \u00feara, \u00fee hwonlice gima\u00f0 and lithwon recca\u00f0 ymbe boca beboda o\u00f0\u00f0e biscpa lare\nEt psalmista terribiliter loquitur dicens: Qui noluit benedictionem, prolongabitur ab eo.\nBe Eorlum.\nEorlas and heretogan and \u00feas worlddeman and eac swa gerefan agan neod\u00feearfe, \u00fe\u00e6t hi riht lufian for\nAc a hi sculon circan ofer ealle o\u00f0re \u00feingc weor\u00f0ian and werian, and wuduwan and steopcild hi sculon\nAnd \u00feeofas and \u00feeodsca\u00f0an hi sculon hatigan, and riperas and reaferas hi sculon hynan, buton hi\nAnd symle hi sculon a unriht swi\u00f0e ascunian.\nFor\u00feam so\u00f0 is, \u00fe\u00e6t ic secge, gelife, se \u00f0e wille: Wa \u00f0am, \u00fee woh dryf\u00f0, buton he geswice.\nWitod he sceal drefan dymne and deopne hellewites grund, helpes bed\u00e6led.\nAc to lyt is \u00feara nu \u00f0a, \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t understande, swa swa man scolde.\nAc do freonda gehwilc, ealswa hit \u00feearf is, warnige hine silfne and beorge him georne, \u00fe\u00e6t he Gode ne\nBe sacerdum.\nRiht is, \u00fe\u00e6t sacerdas on heora scriftscirum willice and w\u00e6rlice l\u00e6ran and l\u00e6dan \u00fea godcundan heorda,\nAnd \u00e6g\u00f0er hi sculon, ge wel bodian ge wel bisnian and Godes circan geornlice lufian and for eal cristen\nBe gehadedum mannum.\nEallum cristenum mannum is micel \u00feearf, \u00fe\u00e6t hi riht lufian and unriht ascunian.\nAnd huru gehadedum is \u00fe\u00e6s m\u00e6st \u00feearf, \u00fee \u00e6g\u00f0er sculon ge wel bodian ge wel bisnian o\u00f0rum\nGehadedum mannum gebire\u00f0 \u00e6lc cl\u00e6nnes for\u00f0am \u00fee hi sculon eallum o\u00f0rum mannum \u00e6lce\nAnd \u00e6lce cl\u00e6nnesse hi sculan be heom silfum gebisnian.\n\u00deonne is hit swi\u00f0e egeslic, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea \u00fee scoldan eallum cristenum mannum riht bodian and eac wel\n\u00de\u00e6t sindon \u00fea \u00e6wbrycan, \u00fee \u00feurh healicne had ciric\u00e6we underfengon and \u00fe\u00e6t si\u00f0\u00f0an abr\u00e6can.\nNis nanum weofod\u00feegne alifed, \u00fe\u00e6t he wifian mote, ac is \u00e6lcum forboden.\nNu is \u00feeah \u00feara ealles to fela, \u00fee \u00feone \u00e6wbryce wyrca\u00f0 and geworht habba\u00f0.\nAc ic bidde for Godes lufan and eac eornostlice beode, \u00fe\u00e6t man \u00f0\u00e6s geswice.\nL\u00e6wedum men is \u00e6lc wif forboden, buton his riht\u00e6we; and gehadode syndon sume swa \u00feurh deofol\nAc ic bidde georne, \u00fe\u00e6t man \u00fe\u00e6s geswice.\nCirice is sacerdos \u00e6we.\nNah he mid rihte \u00e6nige o\u00f0re; for\u00f0am ne gebira\u00f0 sacerdan nan \u00f0ingc, na\u00f0or ne to wife ne to worldwige,\nBe abbodum.\nRiht is \u00fe\u00e6t abbodas and huru abbatissan f\u00e6ste on mynstrum singallice wunigan and georne heora\nSwa gebire\u00f0 abbodan and munuchades mannum.\nBe munecum.\nRiht is, \u00fe\u00e6t munecas d\u00e6ges \u00e6nd nihtes inweardre heortan a to Gode \u00feencan and geornlice clypian and\nFiligan heora bocum and gebedum georne and \u00e6ghwilce wl\u00e6nce and idele r\u00e6nce and sindrige \u00e6hta and\nSwa gebyre\u00f0 munecan.\nBe minecenan.\nRiht is, \u00fe\u00e6t mynicena mynsterlice macian, efne swa we cw\u00e6don \u00e6ror be munecum, and n\u00e6fre wi\u00f0\nBe preostum and be nunnan.\nRyht is, \u00fe\u00e6t preostas and efen wel nunnan regollice libban and cl\u00e6nnesse healdan be \u00feam, \u00fee hi willan\nGehadodum mannum gebire\u00f0 \u00e6lc cl\u00e6nnes, for\u00f0am \u00fee hy sculon eallum o\u00f0rum mannum \u00e6lce\nBe l\u00e6wedum mannum.\nRiht is, \u00fe\u00e6t gehadode men \u00feam l\u00e6wedum wissian, hu hi heora \u00e6we rihtost sculon healdan.\n\u00d0\u00e6t bi\u00f0 rihtlic lif, \u00fe\u00e6t cniht \u00feurhwunige on hys cnihthade, o\u00f0\u00f0\u00e6t he on rihtre m\u00e6den\u00e6we gewifige and\nGif hire \u00feonne for\u00f0si\u00f0 getimige, \u00feonne is rihtast, \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00feanonfor\u00f0 wuduwa \u00feurhwunige; \u00feeah be \u00fe\u00e6s\nAnd \u00feeah l\u00e6wedum mannum wif sy alifed, \u00feeah hi agon \u00feearfe, \u00fe\u00e6t hi understandan, hu hit is alifed.\nNagan l\u00e6wede men freolstidum ne f\u00e6stentidum \u00feurh h\u00e6med\u00feingc wifes gemanan, \u00fee ma \u00fee heahhades\nBe wudewan.\nRiht is, \u00fe\u00e6t wuduwan Annan bysene georne filigan.\nSeo w\u00e6s on temple d\u00e6ges and nihtes, \u00feeowigende georne.\nHeo f\u00e6ste swi\u00f0e \u00feearle and gebedum filigde and geomrigendum mode cliopode to Criste and \u00e6lmessan\nSwa sceal god wuduwe hiran hyre drihtene.\nBi circan.\nRiht is, \u00fe\u00e6t cristene men cristendom georne healdan mid rihte and Cristes cirican \u00e6ghwar geornlice\nEalle we habba\u00f0 \u00e6nne heofonlicne f\u00e6der and ane gastlice modor, seo is ecclesia genamod, \u00fe\u00e6t is\nAnd riht is, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lc cirice sy on Godes gri\u00f0e and on ealles cristenes folces; and \u00fe\u00e6t ciricgri\u00f0 stande\nFor\u00f0am \u00e6lc ciricgri\u00f0 is Cristes agen gri\u00f0, and \u00e6lc cristen man ah micele \u00feearfe, \u00fe\u00e6t he on \u00f0am gri\u00f0e\nFor\u00f0am \u00e6lces cristenes mannes nyd\u00feearf is, \u00fe\u00e6t he Godes cirican lufige and wur\u00f0ige and hi gelomlice\nAnd huru gehadode \u00fear sculon oftost \u00feeowian and \u00feenian and for eal cristen folc \u00feingian georne.\n\u00d0onne agan weofod\u00feegnas to smeagenne symle, \u00fe\u00e6t hi huru\u00feinga heora lif fadian, swa swa to circan\nCirice is mid rihte sacerdes \u00e6we, and se \u00fee to circan wur\u00f0e gehadod, nage hine \u00e6nig man, \u00fee Godes\nAnd \u00feonne sceal Cristes scirgerefa \u00fe\u00e6t witan and ymbe \u00fe\u00e6t dihtan and deman, swa swa bec t\u00e6can.\nNe scolde man \u00e6fre circan derian ne \u00e6nig woh beodan on \u00e6nige wisan.\nAc nu sindon \u00feeah circan wide wace gegri\u00f0ode and ifele ge\u00feeowode cl\u00e6ne beripte ealra gerihta and\nAnd ciric\u00feenas sindon m\u00e6\u00f0e and munde wel gehwar bed\u00e6lede.\nAnd wa \u00f0am, \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6s wealt, \u00feeah he swa ne wene.\nFor\u00f0am \u00e6lc \u00feara bi\u00f0 witodlice Godes silfes feond, \u00fee bi\u00f0 Godes ciricena feond and \u00fee Godes ciricena\nAnd egeslice spr\u00e6c sanctus Gregorius be \u00feam eac, \u00fea \u00f0a he \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0: Si quis ecclesiam Christi\nAd quod respondentes omnes dixerunt: amen.\nMicel is neod\u00feearf manna gehwilcum, \u00fe\u00e6t he wi\u00f0 \u00f0as \u00feingc beorge hym georne; and \u00e6ghwilc Godes\nEalle we sculon \u00e6nne God lufian and wur\u00f0ian and \u00e6nne cristendom georne healdan and \u00e6lcne\nBe eallum cristenum mannum.\nRiht is, \u00fe\u00e6t ealle cristene men heora cristendom rihtlice healdan and \u00feam life libban, \u00fee heom to\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t is \u00feonne \u00e6rest r\u00e6da firmest, \u00fe\u00e6t manna gehwilc ofer ealle o\u00f0re \u00feingc \u00e6nne God lufige and\nAnd eac we agan \u00feearfe, \u00fe\u00e6t we geornlice smeagan, hu we symle magon Godes agene beboda\n\u00de\u00e6t is \u00feonne \u00e6rest, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t man behate\u00f0, \u00feonne man fulluhtes girne\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t man aa wille deofol\nAnd \u00f0onne b